  "title": "test: Quiet pytest warning about an iterator that cannot be reused",
  "description": "pathlib.Path.glob yields a lazy generator, which is exhausted after\nthe first time it is iterated through, and using such as-is with\n@pytest.mark.parametrize is deprecated due to unexpected behavior:\n\nhttps://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/deprecations.html#parametrize-iterators\n\nConvert the case in the Zabbix group to a list.",
